# Who is asked to review what.
#
# One maintainer today, so every line resolves to the same handle. The file is not therefore
# pointless: it is the list of paths where a second reviewer will be added first, and it makes the
# load-bearing directories explicit — a change under `docs/`, `tools/gates/` or the vault is a
# different kind of change from one under `apps/web/src/routes/`.
#
# Ordering is last-match-wins, so the general rule is first and the sharp edges are last.

*                                   @actuallyhoss

# ── The design, which is the source of truth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Code that disagrees with a document is a defect in one of the two. Amending a document is a
# decision, not an edit.
/docs/                              @actuallyhoss
/docs/16-DECISIONS.md               @actuallyhoss
/docs/12-SECURITY.md                @actuallyhoss
/README.md                          @actuallyhoss

# ── Governance, licensing and disclosure ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/LICENSE                            @actuallyhoss
/LICENSING.md                       @actuallyhoss
/SECURITY.md                        @actuallyhoss
/CONTRIBUTING.md                    @actuallyhoss
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                 @actuallyhoss
/.github/                           @actuallyhoss

# ── The things that decide whether a green run means anything ─────────────────────────────────────
/tools/gates/                       @actuallyhoss
/tools/gates/negative/              @actuallyhoss
/tools/gates/budgets.json           @actuallyhoss
/.github/workflows/                 @actuallyhoss

# ── Supply chain ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A dependency is an ADR, not a line in a manifest (ADR-046).
/package.json                       @actuallyhoss
/pnpm-lock.yaml                     @actuallyhoss
/pnpm-workspace.yaml                @actuallyhoss
/.gitattributes                     @actuallyhoss
/tsconfig.base.json                 @actuallyhoss

# ── The record's core ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# One write path, an append-only ledger, and the closed lists the whole product is typed against.
/packages/kernel/                   @actuallyhoss
/packages/ports/                    @actuallyhoss
/packages/record/                   @actuallyhoss
/packages/declare/                  @actuallyhoss

# ── The agent surface ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
